WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Try to see if this can be copied

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,960
I also want to copy this kind of good thing

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,120
I really want to give you face, okay?

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:11,400
As expected, I can only copy technical medicines.

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,640
It's not cold anymore

6
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:21,350
This vest is not thick to the touch. It’s really amazing.

7
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:22,830
The wind blowing at minus fifty degrees was blowing on my face

8
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:25,100
I don’t feel like a serving young master at all.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,460
I opened the crafting table and the drawings of Pressure Ao

10
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,100
It’s a super warm compression bag

11
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:33,300
Wearing it on the body can withstand the cold better than cotton clothes. How much does it cost to sell it?

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,420
But I won’t sell it to you and the young master.

13
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,900
Yesterday you helped the single-family house seek defeat.

14
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,380
A bully laughs at me

15
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,940
You deserve to be frozen to death today
